<title>USA: U.S. barge rates - Lightly quoted on call.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates - Lightly quoted on call.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates were lightly quoted Monday on the St. Louis Merchants Exchange call session. There were no trades versus 16 option trades on Friday. There was only one bid and no offers.</p>
<p>- 18 barges, two each week May/June, Mississippi River (St. Paul through Savage) bid at 145 percent of tariff, no offer.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
